# MFC Mission Editor is real source: force its whole tree (incl. the
# *.rc resource script + the *.ico/*.bmp/*.cur it #includes) to be
# tracked, overriding the generic binary ignores above. The old bare
# `Editor` + global `*.rc` rules silently kept the editor resource
# script untracked (it builds, but LoadFrame(IDR_EDITOR_MENU) fails).
!editor/
!editor/**
data/*
!data/defs/
!data/hdr/
!data/visual_tuning.json
!data/terrain_materials.json
!data/vegetation/
!data/vegetation/**
# Cement-pad proper asset fix (deferred item 3): mat6_normal.tga is the
# painted-concrete NORMAL map for matNormalArray layer 6 (MAT_LAYER_PAINTED_CONC).
# Tracked + shipped via deploy_payload.py GAME_DATA_PAYLOAD so installs can never
# drift back to the 2026-06-14 albedo-in-normal-slot swap. Other loose textures
# under data/textures/ stay ignored (*.tga rule above still applies).
!data/textures/
!data/textures/mat6_normal.tga
unpacked_data
unpacked_data--
